@startuml
title Student verification status | FR-002/019 | BR-002–006/070
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam activityBorderColor #475569
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #475569
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam stateBorderColor #475569
state "Awaiting review" as pending
state "Approved" as approved
state "Rejected" as rejected
state "Revoked" as revoked
[*] --> pending : Student submits proof
pending --> approved : Administrator approves
pending --> rejected : Administrator rejects with a reason
pending --> revoked : Administrator revokes with a reason
approved --> revoked : Administrator revokes with a reason
rejected --> [*]
revoked --> [*]
note right of approved
 Approval does not expire in the current implementation.
 Another submission is blocked while awaiting review or approved.
 Records are retained.
end note
note right of revoked
 Update the student's eligibility in the background.
 Re-verification begins with a new submission awaiting review.
end note
@enduml
